ck divider. R13 is not mentioned in the spec.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"FB(1) is tied directly to +3V3 (consistent with AP63203WU being a fixed 3.3 V output part ... so no external feedback divider is needed)\"},\n        {\"source\": \"schematic\", \"quote\": \"R13 51.1k between FB (U8 pin 1) and +3V3 / GND junction (power.kicad_sch, Power sheet)\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"An extra resistor on FB changes the feedback network and may shift the output voltage or add a parasitic load from the 3.3 V rail to ground.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The schematic is largely consistent with the spec, but two items deviate from it: an extra screw terminal J5 wired across the heater output to GND, and an unexpected 51.1k resistor R13 in the fixed-output regulator's FB network. Both are moderate-confidence readings of a dense drawing.\"\n}",
